{"id":"n5-027","title":"Noun ぐらい～ (Noun gurai～)","jlptLevel":5,"shortExplanation":"Express an approximate amount or degree; 'about', 'approximately'.","longExplanation":"The ぐらい grammar point is used with nouns to express an approximate amount or degree. It is often translated as 'about', 'approximately', or 'around' in English. This can be used for time, quantity, or other measurements.","formation":"Noun + ぐらい","examples":[{"jp":"一日中勉強したので、１０時間ぐらい勉強しました。","romaji":"Ichinichijuu benkyou shita node, juu-jikan gurai benkyou shimashita.","en":"I studied all day, so I studied for about 10 hours.","words":[{"surface":"一","vocabId":"1160790","reading":"いち"},{"surface":"日","vocabId":"1463770","reading":"ひ"},{"surface":"中","vocabId":"1423310","reading":"なか"},{"surface":"勉強","vocabId":"1512670","reading":"べんきょう"},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ので","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"１","vocabId":"1160790","reading":"いち"},{"surface":"０","vocabId":null},{"surface":"時間","vocabId":"1315920","reading":"じかん"},{"surface":"ぐらい","vocabId":null},{"surface":"勉強","vocabId":"1512670","reading":"べんきょう"},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"まし","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[11]},{"jp":"この本は１００ページぐらいある。","romaji":"Kono hon wa hyaku peeji gurai aru.","en":"This book has about 100 pages.","words":[{"surface":"この","vocabId":null},{"surface":"本","vocabId":"1522150","reading":"ほん"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"１","vocabId":"1160790","reading":"いち"},{"surface":"０","vocabId":null},{"surface":"０","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ページ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ぐらい","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ある","vocabId":"1296400","reading":"ある"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[7]},{"jp":"彼は果物を５個ぐらい食べました。","romaji":"Kare wa kudamono o go-ko gurai tabemashi